prompt The Dream seat prompt: take one bounded Systems Core constellation lap, reds first, council row N mod 5, QA on touch, twice-pulled send, path-limited signing, and stop at custody gates.
think OTHER HAND BEFORE A FILE MOVED. Claude Code is the other hand on the anointed line, most recently the Hush loom lap; this checkout was clean and separate, and every commit in this lap stays path-limited.
think ROTA. N=3820 gives row 0, AETHER -- why the work exists, heard through the compass, the long return, and the crossing. The row says the durable move is the direct witness that makes a module answer for itself, rather than another prose claim about indirect coverage.
think REDS FIRST. The cold roster read four reds. equinox_e123_living_pin_guard and dated_pattern both passed unchanged inside `nix-shell -p ripgrep`; this pier's bare PATH has no rg, so those two are a machine limit rather than a tree defect. rule_twin is custody gate %7. pond_enclosure_door is Hush's gated switchover seam. No agent-closable tree red stood in this lane.
think CLAIM. Scribe's constellation row already landed at e59df1bb70. Tally's choir-and-bijection row was the oldest ungated Systems Core row still open, and Kumara was its one remaining uncovered module.
think MY FIRST WITNESS CONSTRUCTION REDDED. The direct caller embedded inside a Rishi string crossed the interpreter's interpolation grammar before Rye ran. I moved the caller into a tracked Rye fixture, so the witness copies readable source and quoting is no longer part of the claim.
obs THE SEAM IS PROVEN FROM BOTH SIDES. One fixture seed produces the same public key twice, signs once, and verifies through the typed and raw-byte doors. A changed message and a 63-byte signature refuse by name. In separate pen builds, removing either refusal makes the same caller fail with TamperAccepted or ShortAccepted, so neither wall is decoration.
obs THE MACHINE LIMIT AND TREE DEFECT ARE SEPARATE. The bare pier PATH lacks rg; unchanged guards green when ripgrep is supplied by Nix. The new Kumara caller instead failed inside tracked witness construction and was repaired in this lap. One belongs to the bench; one belonged to this package.
obs THE TALLY ROW IS WHOLE. Fourteen modules now read as eleven directly covered plus three test programs, uncovered zero, ceiling zero. The roster still plants a newborn with no witness, refuses it, and heals only when its direct witness arrives.
